  "description": "Core transport for shipping logs and product-analytics events to a ZipLogger server: bounded queues, batching, retry with backoff, drop-on-backpressure, automatic enrichment, and Track()/Identify() for events. Usually consumed via ZipLogger.Extensions.Logging or ZipLogger.Serilog. Sign up free at https://ziplogger.dev.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
